# Interactive form (fixture 36)

Widgets used by `teml run` are still fully declarative outside an
interactive session: `teml view`/`convert`/`render` show them as static
controls with no focus marker, same as any other leaf directive.

::input{id="name" label="Name" placeholder="your name"}

::input{id="email" label="Email" value="ada@example.com"}

::checkbox{id="agree" label="I agree to the terms" checked="true"}

::checkbox{id="newsletter" label="Send me the newsletter"}

::button{id="submit" label="Submit"}

:::card{title="Nested in a card"}
::input{id="nested" label="Also focusable"}
::button{id="nested-ok" label="OK"}
:::
